00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Survol\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Focus clavier\n\u00a0\u00a01\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Liens de l'attribution\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0soulignement retir\u00e9\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0contour 2 px d\u00e9cal\u00e9 de 2 px\n\nLe design n'a aucun \u00e9l\u00e9ment cliquable : l'image du QR code n'est\npas un lien (elle se scanne).", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895215836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1362896669, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "qr-2b", "type": "rectangle", "x": 67240, "y": 2222, "width": 1240, "height": 200, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jG", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1737793159, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793895215836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1120981651}, {"id": "qr-2b-t", "type": "text", "x": 67264, "y": 2242, "width": 374, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jH", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2B \u00b7 Contrastes (AA : 4,5:1 texte)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 294554478, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2B \u00b7 Contrastes (AA : 4,5:1 texte)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895215836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1811254886, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "qr-2b-b", "type": "text", "x": 67264, "y": 2286, "width": 1192, "height": 80, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 16, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jI", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK, juste : paragraphe Slate 500 sur blanc 4,55:1.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : titre Slate 900 12,86:1 ; attribution : liens #3E52A3\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a05,44:1 et texte Slate 900 9,79:1 sur Slate 300.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Image : QR code blanc sur bleu, contenu (texte alternatif).", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 224464284, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK, juste : paragraphe Slate 500 sur blanc 4,55:1.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : titre Slate 900 12,86:1 ; attribution : liens #3E52A3\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a05,44:1 et texte Slate 900 9,79:1 sur Slate 300.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Image : QR code blanc sur bleu, contenu (texte alternatif).", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895215836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 46252516, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "qr-2d-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 65980, "y": 2442, "width": 2520, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jJ", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 732370061, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "updated": 1793895215836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 732164575}, {"id": "qr-2d-t", "type": "text", "x": 66000, "y": 2462, "width": 748, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jK", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 513078550, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895215836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 873074210, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "qr-2d-b", "type": "text", "x": 66000, "y": 2506, "width": 2480, "height": 106.25, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0jL", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Q-B1\u00a0\u00a0Texte alternatif du QR code. (\u00ab QR code to frontendmentor.io \u00bb : ce que la personne trouvera en le scannant.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Niveau du titre. (h1 : le composant est seul sur la page.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (La m\u00eame carte centr\u00e9e \u00e0 toutes les largeurs ; 16 px de marge \u00e0 320 px.)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Attribution absente des images. (Gard\u00e9e sous la carte comme au lot 1 : 11 px, liens #3E52A3 soulign\u00e9s, survol sans soulignement, contour de focus 2 px.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0Refonte. (M\u00eame d\u00e9p\u00f4t front-ui-qrcode en v2.0.0, historique gard\u00e9 ; site sur GitHub Pages ; FM : \u00ab Edit solution \u00bb avec un vrai titre et la nouvelle adresse.)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 789080482, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Q-B1\u00a0\u00a0Texte alternatif du QR code. (\u00ab QR code to frontendmentor.io \u00bb : ce que la personne trouvera en le scannant.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Niveau du titre. (h1 : le composant est seul sur la page.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (La m\u00eame carte centr\u00e9e \u00e0 toutes les largeurs ; 16 px de marge \u00e0 320 px.)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Attribution absente des images. (Gard\u00e9e sous la carte comme au lot 1 : 11 px, liens #3E52A3 soulign\u00e9s, survol sans soulignement, contour de focus 2 px.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0Refonte. (M\u00eame d\u00e9p\u00f4t front-ui-qrcode en v2.0.0, historique gard\u00e9 ; site sur GitHub Pages ; FM : \u00ab Edit solution \u00bb avec un vrai titre et la nouvelle adresse.)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793895215836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 881123130, "verticalAlign": "top"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {"qr-img-d-file": {"id": "qr-img-d-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793895144866}, "qr-img-m-file": {"id": "qr-img-m-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793895144866}}}